(text "Native SD GPIOs: CLK 26 (through R58, 22 ohm); CMD 27; DAT0-DAT3 28-31.\nAll six signals are in the GPIO16-31 overlap of both PIO windows.\nR58 is on the MCU sheet: place physically next to U20 GPIO26. Tune 0-33 ohm if needed.\nKeep the bus short and direct over continuous GND, away from switching/high-current copper." (at 10 175 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 1e36da20-1b37-4f07-9fda-5b173069b9f1))
)
